---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Gallery from '../../components/Gallery.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Workbench"
  description="To facilitate my woodworking hobby, I designed and built this workbench taking inspiration from the English Nicholson style of workbench."
  image="/images/img_0158.jpg"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Workbench</h1>
    </header>
    <article class="project">
      <Gallery
        variant="hero-side"
        images={[
          { src: '/images/img_0158.jpg', alt: 'Finished workbench' },
          { src: '/images/img_0159.jpg', alt: 'Workbench with table saw' },
          { src: '/images/render-3.jpg', alt: 'Workbench 3D render' },
        ]}
      />
      <Gallery variant="single" images={[{ src: '/images/render-2.jpg', alt: 'Workbench 3D render, other angle' }]} />
      <p>
        To facilitate my woodworking hobby, I designed and built this workbench taking inspiration from the English Nicholson style of workbench. It also includes a section for a jobsite table saw which allows the tabletop to be used as an outfeed.
      </p>
      <p>
        There are still some finishing touches to be made including drilling dog holes and adding a vise or two. For the moment, it is serving me well.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
